@startuml state-application
!pragma layout smetana
!include _style.puml
title State Machine — application lifecycle (born Submitted, ADR-0024)

[*] --> Submitted : applicant submits

state "Interim" as I {
  Submitted --> UnderReview : SAO triage
  UnderReview --> DocumentsRequested : request documents
  DocumentsRequested --> UnderReview : documents resubmitted\n/ accepted
}

Submitted --> Admitted : decide [admit]
UnderReview --> Admitted : decide [admit]
UnderReview --> Rejected : decide [reject]
UnderReview --> Waitlisted : decide [waitlist]
Submitted --> Rejected : decide [reject]

Admitted --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Waitlisted --> Withdrawn : re-enrollment merge
Waitlisted --> [*]
Withdrawn --> [*]

note bottom of I : Terminal states\n(Admitted / Rejected /\nWaitlisted / Withdrawn)\nblock further transitions
@enduml
